{"version":1,"content":"<p>網約車平台Uber正在推出一項名為「錄像行程」（Recorded Rides）的新功能，允許乘客在預訂行程時選擇全程由司機手機前置攝像頭進行音視頻記錄。該選項將出現在UberX、UberXL等常規車型旁，目前率先在美國巴爾的摩、印第安納波利斯、聖路易斯以及北卡羅來納州羅利上線。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587826.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.416482+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:06:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:15.552671+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:15.552671+00:00","content_hash":"d19634fbe5cd6daf3754e1ab7f36795233b2c23b7cd7068d345c15f480986678","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}